@* A group in a site's menu (FX73): one word in the menu bar that opens the links it holds, on hover or on focus, so a
   menu with many pages stays one line. The site puts its links inside; the styles beside this file do the opening,
   with no script. *@
<div class="site-menu">
    <button type="button" class="site-menu-label" aria-haspopup="true">@Label</button>
    <div class="site-menu-list">@ChildContent</div>
</div>
